  "title": "The Lady of the Weir",
  "subtitle": "A starter adventure for OSRIC in Aun",
  "summary": "An eel-fishing village's small god is failing, the dead walk the river path, and the man who hired you has a secret.",
  "description": "A day's walk up the Ambre from Hask, the Lady of the Weir's pool has turned black, the eels are dying and three people have vanished on the river path. The Reeve blames the greedy young lord who leases the weir. The truth is closer to home, and the ending is the players' to choose.\n\nAn evening's adventure for four to six characters of 1st and 2nd level: a valley to roam, a fortified house, a sorcerer-era vault in the riverbank, a god to bargain with, and a choice with a price.",
